# The release of anti-lang/llvm-tools that the LLVM tools of every host come
# from. The version stands in tools/llvm-version alone, and @VERSION@ takes
# it. The tag adds the counter of the rebuilds of that version. An asset is
# named after the tag and the host, which @TAG@ and @HOST@ take. Each digest
# is the SHA-256 of the asset of that host. The release also carries an
# archive for macos-x86_64, which antic does not support and never downloads.
